# docs-html/ IS committed, so the rendered docs can be shared with people who will not run the
# script. Regenerate with `node scripts/build-docs-html.mjs` in the same commit as any .md edit —
# a stale copy still looks authoritative, which is the whole hazard of checking generated files in.
